      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُخْصُومٌ</span></b>  The <i>loop of the</i> [<i>sack called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُوَالِق</span>,
(JK, TA,) and <i>of the</i> [<i>load called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِدْل</span>; (TA;)
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُخْسُومٌ</span>; (K;) but the latter is a dial. var.
of weak authority, and disapproved. (TA in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خسم</span>.)

